  <div class="featured">
    <div class="top"><span>Featured</span><span>[1]</span><span class="badge-nature">Nature Portfolio</span><span class="badge">Peer reviewed</span></div>
    <h3>A data-centric approach to detecting and mitigating demographic bias in pediatric mental health text</h3>
    <p class="venue">Communications Medicine (Nature Portfolio) · March 2026</p>
    <p class="desc">Achieved a 27% reduction in diagnostic bias and a 4% accuracy gain for female patients through neutralised language and data-centric mitigation. The work improves diagnostic equity in pediatric mental health AI.</p>

    <figure class="result-chart">
      <figcaption class="chart-caption">Effect of data-centric mitigation, female patients</figcaption>
      <div class="chart-key">
        <span><i class="dot before"></i>Before</span>
        <span><i class="dot after"></i>After</span>
      </div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 400 90" role="img" aria-labelledby="chart-title-1 chart-desc-1" class="dumbbell">
        <title id="chart-title-1">Bias score and diagnostic accuracy, before and after mitigation</title>
        <desc id="chart-desc-1">Bias score fell from a normalised 100 to 73, a 27% reduction. Diagnostic accuracy for female patients rose from 84% to 88%, a 4 percentage point gain.</desc>

        <text x="290" y="10" class="value-label">27% lower bias</text>
        <line x1="140" y1="24" x2="290" y2="24" class="connector" />
        <circle cx="140" cy="24" r="5" class="dot-mark before" />
        <circle cx="290" cy="24" r="5" class="dot-mark after" />
        <text x="10" y="28" class="row-label">Bias score</text>
        <text x="140" y="42" class="tick-label" text-anchor="middle">100</text>
        <text x="290" y="42" class="tick-label" text-anchor="middle">73</text>

        <text x="290" y="56" class="value-label">+4pp accuracy</text>
        <line x1="140" y1="70" x2="200" y2="70" class="connector" />
        <circle cx="140" cy="70" r="5" class="dot-mark before" />
        <circle cx="200" cy="70" r="5" class="dot-mark after" />
        <text x="10" y="74" class="row-label">Accuracy (female)</text>
        <text x="140" y="88" class="tick-label" text-anchor="middle">84%</text>
        <text x="200" y="88" class="tick-label" text-anchor="middle">88%</text>
      </svg>
    </figure>
  </div>
